  "details": "Quest standalone: Opening a wing and selecting emotes shows the names of the default expression name set, regardless of the actual animation name uploaded with the (SDK2.0) avatar. \nEg. EMOTE1 default is 'Wave'. I have swapped the animation for another in Unity 2019.4.31f1  which has another name, say \"Whistle\". The emote on the VRChat tab is still listed as 'Wave'.\nCurrently Steam desktop still uses the previous UI and reads the uploaded emote name correctly.",
